# Build context for `docker/soak/Dockerfile`, whose context is the repo
# root because the examples depend on `crates/rustango` by path.
#
# Without this file the context is ~24 GB — `target/` alone is 8.6 GB and
# `target-examples/` another 2.6 GB — all of it uploaded to the daemon on
# every build, and `.env` baked into the image alongside it.

# Build output. The single biggest thing here.
target/
target-examples/
**/target/

# Secrets. `.env.example` is the committed template and is safe to ship.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local databases — a SQLite file copied into an image is a data leak
# and a stale-state bug at the same time.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
var/

# Nothing in the image reads these.
.git/
.github/
docs/
**/node_modules/
**/e2e/playwright-report/
**/e2e/test-results/
*.log

# Editor / OS noise.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
